        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>住宿建议 - 选酒店关注点</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    background-color: #f2ede1;\n    background-image: repeating-linear-gradient(0deg, rgba(0,0,0,0.015) 0px, rgba(0,0,0,0.015) 1px, transparent 1px, transparent 3px);\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"SimHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #2b2b2b;\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 30px 25px;\n    max-width: 560px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n\n  .title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 34px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    letter-spacing: 4px;\n    margin: 20px 0 30px 0;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n  }\n\n  .subtitle-wrap {\n    text-align: center;\n    margin-bottom: 40px;\n  }\n\n  .subtitle {\n    display: inline-block;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    position: relative;\n    padding: 0 5px;\n  }\n\n  .subtitle::after {\n    content: \"\";\n    display: block;\n    width: 110%;\n    height: 8px;\n    margin-left: -5%;\n    margin-top: 2px;\n    background-image: url(\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='100' height='8'><path d='M0,4 Q5,0 10,4 T20,4 T30,4 T40,4 T50,4 T60,4 T70,4 T80,4 T90,4 T100,4' stroke='%23d9534f' fill='none' stroke-width='1.3'/></svg>\");\n    background-repeat: repeat-x;\n  }\n\n  .para {\n    margin: 0 0 26px 0;\n    font-size: 14.5px;\n    line-height: 2;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n\n  .label {\n    font-weight: bold;\n  }\n\n  .u {\n    position: relative;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    border-bottom: 1.3px solid #d9534f;\n  }\n\n  .u2 {\n    position: relative;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    background-image: url(\"data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='100' height='6'><path d='M0,3 Q2.5,0 5,3 T10,3 T15,3 T20,3 T25,3 T30,3 T35,3 T40,3 T45,3 T50,3 T55,3 T60,3 T65,3 T70,3 T75,3 T80,3 T85,3 T90,3 T95,3 T100,3' stroke='%23d9534f' fill='none' stroke-width='1'/></svg>\");\n    background-repeat: repeat-x;\n    background-position: bottom;\n    background-size: 14px 6px;\n    padding-bottom: 2px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div class=\"title\">住宿建议</div>\n\n  <div class=\"subtitle-wrap\">\n    <span class=\"subtitle\">[ 选酒店关注点 ]</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <p class=\"para\">\n    <span class=\"label\">[沙滩]</span>：亲子家庭出行游，<span class=\"u2\">对沙滩的质量和海水的选择上要</span>干净、清澈，<span class=\"u2\">沙子细软不扎脚的</span>。有私人海滩更佳\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"para\">\n    <span class=\"label\">[酒店设施]</span>：针对酒店的洗护有没有提供宝宝专用，以及宝宝专用的洗漱台和马桶等等，以及有没有婴儿床、床围等床上用品提供\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"para\">\n    <span class=\"label\">[房间]</span>：房间主题最好有小朋友喜欢的主题，比如太空主题的房间或者星空主题的房间；以及房间有没有提供儿童帐篷、滑梯等玩乐设施。<span class=\"u2\">房型面积最好大一些</span>，有足够的空间给小朋友跑跳玩乐\n  </p>\n\n  <p class=\"para\">\n    <span class=\"label\">[儿童玩乐设施]</span>：看酒店儿童玩乐设施室内还是室外.设施是不是每日一消毒，<span class=\"u2\">看空间宽不宽敞</span>。有没有家长休息区。有没有托管服务，托管时间，托管玩的项目等具体小朋友玩乐细节\n  </p>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
